# Who must approve what. Pair with branch protection on main:
# "Require a pull request", "Require review from Code Owners", and the
# "Validate requests" status check.
#
# In an organization, replace the user with GitHub teams, e.g.
#   /requests/team-alpha/   @acme/team-alpha-leads @acme/identity-platform

# Default: the platform owner reviews everything.
*                         @paimonsoror

# Repository policy and pipelines: identity platform / security only.
/requests/.policy.yaml    @paimonsoror
/.github/                 @paimonsoror
/deploy/argocd/           @paimonsoror

# Each team approves its own requests.
/requests/team-alpha/     @paimonsoror
/requests/team-bravo/     @paimonsoror
